{
  "task_id": "LoggerService-005",
  "name": "实现 deployment.logStream 接口",
  "description": "实现 Electron IPC SSE 接口 deployment:log，作为渲染进程与 LoggerService 之间的桥梁。\n\n1. IPC 频道注册: 在主进程注册 'deployment:log' 频道，接收 deploymentId 参数（IF-001 定义）\n\n2. 事件流格式: 遵循 SSE(event-stream)协议，每条日志为一个 JSON 事件:\n   - event: 'log' → data: LogEntry JSON（含 timestamp, level, message, metadata, deploymentId）\n   - event: 'stream:start' → data: { deploymentId, startedAt }\n   - event: 'stream:end' → data: { deploymentId, endedAt }\n   - event: 'error' → data: { code, message }（INVALID_PARAMS / DUPLICATE_STREAM / PERSISTENCE_FAILURE）\n\n3. 参数校验: deploymentId 必须为非空字符串（IF-001 validation_rules），无效时返回 INVALID_PARAMS 错误事件并断开流\n\n4. 重复流检测: 同一 deploymentId 已有活跃流时返回 DUPLICATE_STREAM 错误\n\n5. 生命周期绑定: 监听 Electron BrowserWindow 关闭事件，自动清理对应流资源\n\n产出物: src/loggerservice/api/deployment.logstream.ts — IPC 接口实现，含事件序列化、错误转发和资源清理逻辑。",
